#: widgets/HistorySizeWidget.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"When using this option, the scrollback data will be saved to RAM. If you "
"choose a huge value, your system may run out of free RAM and cause serious "
"issues with your system."
msgstr ""
"Uz ovu opciju, podaci prepisa će se sačuvati u RAM‑u. Ako zadate preveliku "
"vrednost, sistemu može ponestati slobodnog RAM‑a, što može izazvati ozbiljne "
"probleme."

#: widgets/HistorySizeWidget.cpp:68
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"When using this option, the scrollback data will be written unencrypted to "
"temporary files. Those temporary files will be deleted automatically when "
"Konsole is closed in a normal manner.<nl/>Use <emphasis>Settings → Configure "
"Konsole → Temporary Files</emphasis> to select the location of the temporary "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Uz ovu opciju, podaci prepisa upisuju se nešifrovani u privremene fajlove, "
"koji se automatski brišu kada se Konsole normalno zatvori.<nl/>Lokaciju "
"privremenih fajlova izaberite pod <emphasis>Podešavanje→Podesi Konsolu…"
"→Privremeni fajlovi</emphasis>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, fixedSizeHistoryButton)
#: widgets/HistorySizeWidget.ui:60
